## 2. `UbotNew.cs` — settlement() 解析版號並寫檔

`Send()` 目前已經在 `TransType=="50"` 時讀取 `OutData.txt`（你的程式碼已有這段模擬），不需再改。要改的是 `settlement()`，取得回應後解析版號並呼叫共用方法寫檔：

```csharp
public Devices.Models.CreditCardModels.CreditCardResponse settlement(Devices.Models.CreditCardModels.CreditCardSettleRequest data)
{
    var reqData = new UbotNewTradeModel()
    {
        TransType = CreditCardEnum.UbotNewTransType.SETTLEMENT.ToCode(),      //"50",
        HostID = data.HostID,
        StoreID = data.StoreID,
        TransDate = data.POSDateTime.ToString("yyMMdd"),
        TransTime = data.POSDateTime.ToString("HHmmss"),
        MerchantCode = data.StoreID
    };

    UbotNewTradeModel respData;
    Devices.Models.CreditCardModels.CreditCardResponse response = null;

    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++)
    {
        Thread.Sleep(3000); //測試起來3秒以上較正常
        respData = Send(reqData);
        response = responseFromModel(respData);

        // 解析結帳回傳的刷卡機版號(8碼)，有值才寫版本文字檔
        string strEDCVersion = respData.ApplicationVersion?.Trim();
        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(strEDCVersion))
        {
            new POS.Devices.DeviceSharedFunctions().CreateDeviceVersionFile("EDCVerson", strEDCVersion);
        }

        if (response.status == Devices.Models.CreditCardModels.CreditCardResponse.CreditCardStatus.Succ)
        {
            break;
        }
    }
    return response;
}
```

`DeviceSharedFunctions.CreateDeviceVersionFile` 不用改，它已經處理資料夾建立、檔案改名、`_不同版號時自動更新`的邏輯，寫出結果會是 `C:\POS\Web\Register\DeviceVersion\EDCVerson_20260818.txt`。

> 注意：需求文字裡檔名一開始寫 `EDCVersion_`，但第2點判斷「有無版號」時寫的是 `EDCVerson_`（少一個 i）。因為寫檔跟判斷要用同一個字串比對前綴才會生效，我統一用 **`EDCVerson`**。如果正式命名要用 `EDCVersion`，兩處（下面 SettlementAll 的判斷 + 這裡的寫檔）要一起改成一致的字串。

## 3. `EDCService.cs` — SettlementAll() 依版號調整清帳順序

取代 `NEWUBOT` 那個 `else if` 區塊：

```csharp
else if (edcType == EDCType.NEWUBOT)
{
    bool hasEdcVersion = !string.IsNullOrEmpty(new POS.Devices.DeviceSharedFunctions().GetDeviceVersion("EDCVerson"));

    if (hasEdcVersion)
    {
        // 有版號：銀聯交易→AE交易→一般交易
        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.CUP.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.CUP = false;

        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.AE.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.AE = false;

        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.CREDITCARD.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.Credit = false;
    }
    else
    {
        // 無版號：一般交易→銀聯交易→AE交易
        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.CREDITCARD.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.Credit = false;

        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.CUP.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.CUP = false;

        generateStoreID();
        res = Settlement(CreditCardEnum.UbotNewHostID.AE.ToCode());
        if (res != CreditCardEnum.ActionStatus.SUCC) result.AE = false;
    }
}
